WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.390
This thing is very cool, 

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:02.559
you're on the street,

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.200
suddenly you are here and you are in Slovenia.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.240
You made me believe.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.800
I really don't have arguments against facts,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.800
I have no arguments that he did here,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.599
I didn't believe it.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.520
I have never seen this kind of picture

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.799
and in front of me I really am.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.519
And will you trade me in the world?

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.266
Folks, 

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:19.799
look,

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.280
I was pretty scared.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.347
It's scary, 

00:00:22.347 --> 00:00:23.070
isn't it? 

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:23.360
Mia,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.640
it's scary for me too,

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.680
but very talented!

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.960
Success for you!

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.560
Keep up the good energy,

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.800
this high astral,

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.680
fixing people's day with happiness!

